---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Icons from '../components/Icons.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | FitMate"
  description="Read the official FitMate Privacy Policy covering website visits, the browser-based BMI tool, and member gym companion experiences."
  canonicalPath="/privacy/"
  isHome={false}
  breadcrumbLabel="Privacy Policy"
>
  <section class="legal-page">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <span aria-current="page">Privacy Policy</span>
      </nav>

      <header class="legal-header">
        <span class="eyebrow">Legal &amp; Trust</span>
        <h1 class="display-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="lead">
          FitMate respects your privacy and keeps your fitness experience transparent, organized, and member-first.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="legal-body surface-card">
        <article class="legal-block">
          <h2>1. Purpose of This Website</h2>
          <p>
            This official FitMate website provides public product information for gym members and fitness clubs. It
            does not require user registration, account creation, or payment processing to browse information or use
            the interactive educational tools on this page.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="legal-block">
          <h2>2. Interactive BMI Calculator</h2>
          <p>
            All height and weight values entered into the on-page BMI calculator are processed solely inside your web
            browser in real time to display an illustrative educational screening figure. Values entered on this public
            website are not transmitted, stored, or shared.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="legal-block">
          <h2>3. App Experience &amp; Participating Gyms</h2>
          <p>
            Within the mobile FitMate companion experience, member details such as attendance and gym membership
            visibility are presented solely to support your connection with your participating gym. FitMate is free for
            individual gym members; gyms contract directly for the FitMate platform.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="legal-block">
          <h2>4. Contact &amp; Updates</h2>
          <p>
            Official FitMate privacy inquiry channels will be published here upon full public directory release. Until
            then, members may also reach out through their participating fitness club regarding club-specific records.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-back">
        <a href="/" class="btn btn--secondary">
          <Icons name="arrow-right" size={16} class="legal-back__icon" />
          Back to FitMate Home
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding-top: calc(var(--nav-height) + 3.5rem);
    padding-bottom: clamp(4rem, 7vw, 6.5rem);
  }

  .breadcrumb {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-subtle);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .breadcrumb a:hover {
    color: var(--accent-primary);
  }

  .legal-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
  }

  .legal-body {
    padding: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .legal-block h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .legal-block p {
    font-size: 0.96rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .legal-back {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  :global(.legal-back__icon) {
    transform: rotate(180deg);
  }
</style>
